# Real publication signing material must never be committed.
# The throwaway development key in keystore/ is committed on purpose
# (see docs/SIGNING.md) so that private side-loaded updates keep the
# same signature. Replace it before any public distribution.
signing-release.properties
*-upload.jks
*-release.jks

